Choose Your Farmer: Select Leo or Clara and start on Day 1 with 150G, three basic tools (Hoe, Watering Can, Scythe), and starter seeds.

Cultivate Crops: Till the soil, plant seeds, water them (to grow 1.8× faster), and harvest mature crops (Turnip, Wheat, Carrot, Strawberry, Tomato).

Care for Animals: Pet Cows and Chickens in the top-right pasture to collect Strawberry Milk (50G) and Farm Fresh Eggs (28G).

Buy & Sell at the Shop (B): Sell harvested crops and animal goods for Gold, buy more seeds, and unlock 3 permanent upgrades (Winged Boots for +35% speed, Golden Watering Can for 3×3 watering, and Lucky Harvest Bell for +1 bonus crop per harvest).

Barn Storage & Saving (C / F5): Transfer items between your Backpack (18 slots) and Barn Storage (24 slots), and save your progress anytime using the Barn menu or F5.
